{"id":"bf5133176eaa12c8","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-completeness-fo.md","title":"Completeness of First-Order Logic","display":"thm-completeness-fo — Completeness of First-Order Logic","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-completeness-fo","aliases":["92-thm-completeness-fo"],"display":"thm-completeness-fo — Completeness of First-Order Logic","depends_on":["[[92-df-logical-consequence]]","[[92-df-provable]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-logical-axiom]]","[[92-ax-modus-ponens]]","[[92-ax-generalization]]","[[92-lem-soundness-fo]]","[[92-df-first-order-language]]","[[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]]","[[92-df-first-order-derivation]]"],"source":"通常一阶完备性背景；Kfoury §5；给定 PDF 讨论算术不完备性","source_status":"外部背景定理；本地演算与一般演算分开陈述"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-completeness-fo"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-completeness-fo</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-completeness-fo — Completeness of First-Order Logic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c75bb5270ee96d5a\" href=\"?note=c75bb5270ee96d5a\" title=\"92-df-logical-consequence\">92-df-logical-consequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e948c25f4a467fa1\" href=\"?note=e948c25f4a467fa1\" title=\"92-df-logical-axiom\">92-df-logical-axiom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"16613851c4bce386\" href=\"?note=16613851c4bce386\" title=\"92-ax-modus-ponens\">92-ax-modus-ponens</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"906680bfce5f44c0\" href=\"?note=906680bfce5f44c0\" title=\"92-ax-generalization\">92-ax-generalization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"29a0403e0c65ae9d\" href=\"?note=29a0403e0c65ae9d\" title=\"92-lem-soundness-fo\">92-lem-soundness-fo</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b230b875687723ed\" href=\"?note=b230b875687723ed\" title=\"92-df-first-order-language\">92-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0b146f0add46bd47\" href=\"?note=0b146f0add46bd47\" title=\"92-df-language-indexed-semantics\">92-df-language-indexed-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"f1751959740e455f\" href=\"?note=f1751959740e455f\" title=\"92-df-first-order-derivation\">92-df-first-order-derivation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"通常一阶完备性背景；Kfoury §5；给定 PDF 讨论算术不完备性"},{"key":"source_status","html":"外部背景定理；本地演算与一般演算分开陈述"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (premise set and conclusion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LogAx}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{LogAx}_G\\)</span> (logical axioms, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"e948c25f4a467fa1\" href=\"?note=e948c25f4a467fa1\" title=\"92-df-logical-axiom\">92-df-logical-axiom</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MP},\\mathrm{Gen}\">\\(\\mathrm{MP},\\mathrm{Gen}\\)</span> (the fixed Hilbert rules, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"16613851c4bce386\" href=\"?note=16613851c4bce386\" title=\"92-ax-modus-ponens\">92-ax-modus-ponens</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"906680bfce5f44c0\" href=\"?note=906680bfce5f44c0\" title=\"92-ax-generalization\">92-ax-generalization</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_\\Phi\">\\(\\mathcal F_\\Phi\\)</span> (definition target for the same premise calculus as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"29a0403e0c65ae9d\" href=\"?note=29a0403e0c65ae9d\" title=\"92-lem-soundness-fo\">92-lem-soundness-fo</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}completeness\\text{-}fo} \\vdash\n\\mathcal F_\\Phi\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_G,\\mathrm{LogAx}_G\\cup\\Phi,\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}),\n\\qquad\n\\Phi\\models_G\\varphi\\Longrightarrow\\mathcal F_\\Phi\\vdash\\varphi\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}completeness\\text{-}fo} \\vdash\n\\mathcal F_\\Phi\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_G,\\mathrm{LogAx}_G\\cup\\Phi,\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}),\n\\qquad\n\\Phi\\models_G\\varphi\\Longrightarrow\\mathcal F_\\Phi\\vdash\\varphi\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>一阶逻辑完备性定理（Gödel 1930）</li>\n<li>与<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"29a0403e0c65ae9d\" href=\"?note=29a0403e0c65ae9d\" title=\"92-lem-soundness-fo\">92-lem-soundness-fo</a>合并可得<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\models_G\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathcal F_\\Phi\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(\\Phi\\models_G\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathcal F_\\Phi\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span>；两边现已使用同一签名和同一明确演算</li>\n<li>这与不完备性定理的区别：\n<ul>\n<li>完备性定理：关于逻辑系统本身</li>\n<li>不完备性定理：关于算术公理系统</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>完备性定理保证逻辑推导&quot;足够强&quot;</li>\n<li>不完备性定理：算术公理系统&quot;有缺口&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"General-Language-Version\">[General Language Version]</h2>\n<p>对<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"b230b875687723ed\" href=\"?note=b230b875687723ed\" title=\"92-df-first-order-language\">92-df-first-order-language</a>中的任意集合签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>，<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"f1751959740e455f\" href=\"?note=f1751959740e455f\" title=\"92-df-first-order-derivation\">92-df-first-order-derivation</a>的有限演算满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash_L\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow T\\models_L\\varphi.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T\\vdash_L\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow T\\models_L\\varphi.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>可靠性对证明行归纳：逻辑公理及等式代入有效，MP 保真；T 全为句子，故 Gen 保真。完备性使用 Henkin 构造：在一致理论中分阶段加入全新常量作存在见证，扩为极大一致理论，再用闭项按可证等式取商。加入一个新常量保证闭项域非空；等式公理使函数和关系解释与等价类代表无关。公式结构归纳给真值引理，约化得到原 T 的模型。反证 T∪{¬φ} 无模型时不相容，再用闭句演绎定理推出 φ。任意集合签名用 ZFC 中的良序选择或极大一致扩张，不把可数语言枚举当成全体签名的算法。</p>\n<p>来源为通常一阶完备性背景，参见 <a href=\"https://www.cs.bu.edu/faculty/kfoury/UNI-Teaching/CS512/AK_Documents_Past_Semesters/compactness.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Kfoury, §5, Theorem 38</a>。这里的证明是数学层面的 Henkin 构造说明，没有证明助手实现。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"General-Language-Version","text":"[General Language Version]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-logical-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"c75bb5270ee96d5a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-logical-consequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-2","target